  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Frederick County</h3>
  <p>
    If you're facing criminal charges in Frederick County, having an experienced defense attorney is crucial. The Frederick County courts handle a full range of criminal matters, from DUI and traffic offenses to drug crimes, assault, and theft. We represent clients at the Frederick County Circuit Court and District Court, providing strategic defense tailored to your specific circumstances. Our goal is to protect your rights and achieve the best possible outcome for your case.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Why Choose Alex Poberesky for Your Frederick County Case?</h3>
  <p>
    Frederick County residents choose Alex Poberesky Law because we deliver experienced, effective legal representation. While some firms may overlook clients from outlying areas, we understand that Frederick County residents deserve the same quality legal services as those in the Baltimore metropolitan core. With over 26 years of experience and a commitment to client service, we're ready to handle your personal injury or criminal defense case. Call today for a free consultation.
  </p>
